[I] System for controlling process state under UNIX

[T] Supervisor is a Python client/server system that allows its users to
[T] monitor and control a number of processes on UNIX-like operating
[T] systems. The supervisord daemon starts and restarts configured programs
[T] and supervisorctl and a web interface allow managing them.

[U] https://supervisord.org/

